# Goal
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped pose  # Target position and orientation in 3D space
float32 speed                   # Desired speed for navigation

---
# Result
bool success                    # Whether the navigation succeeded
string message                  # Optional message for debugging or failure

---
# Feedback
float32 percentage_complete     # Percentage of the path completed
geometry_msgs/PoseStamped current_pose  # Current pose of the drone
